    "此客户已在另一台设备删除，当前修改未保存。请先处理同步冲突。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This customer was deleted on another device. Your changes were not saved. Resolve the sync conflict first."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este cliente se eliminó en otro dispositivo. Los cambios no se guardaron. Resuelve primero el conflicto de sincronización."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この顧客は別のデバイスで削除されました。変更は保存されていません。先に同期の競合を解決してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 고객은 다른 기기에서 삭제되었습니다. 변경 사항은 저장되지 않았습니다. 먼저 동기화 충돌을 해결하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此客戶已在另一部裝置刪除，目前的修改尚未儲存。請先處理同步衝突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此客户已在另一台设备删除，请先处理同步冲突后再查看或编辑。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This customer was deleted on another device. Resolve the sync conflict before viewing or editing it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este cliente se eliminó en otro dispositivo. Resuelve el conflicto de sincronización antes de verlo o editarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
